    {
      "timestamp": 1779963244029,
      "source": "manual",
      "category": "build",
      "content": "W19 TS-debt fix recipe (deferred from W18 Day 99). GitHub Actions \"TypeScript & Security Review\" check fails on every PR (non-blocking — Vercel deploy is real gate, next.config.mjs:19 ignoreBuildErrors:true masks it in build). Root cause: types/database.types.ts is stale — missing tables/columns from migrations 071 (coach_reviews), 072 (users.is_verified), 074 (admin_user_invites). Concrete failing files: services/admin-invites.service.ts (L36-41 deep instantiation + status not assignable), app/api/users/[id]/route.ts (L41 is_verified missing, L61 spread), services/admin-verifications.service.ts, services/coach-reviews.service.ts. Fix in one session: (1) npx supabase gen types typescript --project-id hhyjihbctidtucvpgjzv --schema public > types/database.types.ts, (2) tsc --noEmit to see remainder, (3) flip next.config.mjs ignoreBuildErrors:true → false. Closes W19 candidate \"TypeScript build errors enabled\"."
    },
    {
      "timestamp": 1779968467823,
      "source": "manual",
      "category": "deploy",
      "content": "W20 headline — Next.js upgrade (deferred from W19 Day 4). CRITICAL: 14.2.35 is the LAST 14.x release (line is EOL for security). 14 runtime Next.js advisories unpatched on 14.x — DoS via Image Optimizer remotePatterns (app uses it), HTTP request smuggling in rewrites (app uses redirects()), middleware cache-poisoning (app has middleware), XSS in App Router CSP nonces, SSRF via WebSocket upgrades, RSC cache poisoning. Fixes only in 15.x/16.x. Breaking surface assessed: (1) React 18.3.1→19 required; (2) async params/searchParams — only 5 SERVER components need migration: app/athletes/[id]/page.tsx, app/admin/onboarding-funnel/page.tsx, app/admin/leads/page.tsx, app/share/workout/[token]/page.tsx, app/p/[nickname]/page.tsx (other 14 are client components using useParams() — unaffected); (3) cookies() — 1 call site, already awaited; (4) @supabase/ssr 0.10.0 — verify Next 15 compat. Recommended path: Next 15 first (1 major, 15.3.9 or backport 15.5.18), codemod `npx @next/codemod upgrade`, then 16 separately if needed. npm audit recommends 16.2.6 to clear ALL 14 advisories but 15.x clears the bulk. Now next.config has ignoreBuildErrors:false so upgrade build errors will surface immediately."
    }
  ],
